Bind void to run-it:
    Define names as a series of text.
    Bind void to add-one:
        Insert ("in" joined to "ner") into names.
    Done.
    Pull a rabbit.
        Cast add-one on ().
    Done.
    Define churn as a series of text.
    Define tick as 0.
    While tick is less than 400, repeat:
        Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
        tick becomes tick + 1.
    Done.
    State names.
Done.
Cast run-it on ().
